  "content_type": "narrative",
  "chunks": [
    {
      "chunk_type": "isnad",
      "arabic_text": "عَنْهُ عَنْ حَمَّادِ بْنِ عِيسَى عَنْ عَمْرٍو بْنِ شِمْرٍ عَنْ جَابِرٍ عَنْ أَبِي جَعْفَرٍ عَلَيْهِ السَّلَامُ وَإِبْرَاهِيمَ بْنِ عُمَرَ عَنْ أَبَانٍ رَفَعَهُ إِلَى سُلَيْمِ بْنِ قَيْسٍ الْهِلَالِيِّ رَضِيَ اللَّهُ عَنْهُ قَالَ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "From him, from Hammad ibn Isa, from Amr ibn Shimir, from Jabir, from Abu Ja'far (peace be upon him), and Ibrahim ibn Umar, from Aban, who raised it to Sulaym ibn Qays al-Hilali (may Allah be pleased with him), who said:"
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "opening",
      "arabic_text": "شَهِدْتُ وَصِيَّةَ أَمِيرِ الْمُؤْمِنِينَ عَلَيْهِ السَّلَامُ حِينَ أَوْصَى إِلَى ابْنِهِ الْحَسَنِ وَأَشْهَدَ عَلَى وَصِيَّتِهِ الْحُسَيْنَ عَلَيْهِ السَّلَامُ وَمُحَمَّدًا وَجَمِيعَ وُلْدِهِ وَرُؤَسَاءَ شِيعَتِهِ وَأَهْلَ بَيْتِهِ ثُمَّ دَفَعَ الْكِتَابَ إِلَيْهِ وَالسِّلَاحَ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "I witnessed the will of the Commander of the Faithful (peace be upon him) when he bequeathed to his son al-Hasan, and he made al-Husayn (peace be upon him), Muhammad, all his offspring, the leaders of his shi'a, and the people of his house as witnesses to his will. Then he handed the book and the weapons to him."
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "ثُمَّ قَالَ لِابْنِهِ الْحَسَنِ «يَا بُنَيَّ أَمَرَنِي رَسُولُ اللَّهِ صَلَّى اللَّهُ عَلَيْهِ وَآلِهِ أَنْ أُوصِيَ إِلَيْكَ وَأَنْ أَدْفَعَ إِلَيْكَ كُتُبِي وَسِلَاحِي كَمَا أَوْصَى إِلَيَّ رَسُولُ اللَّهِ صَلَّى اللَّهُ عَلَيْهِ وَآلِهِ وَدَفَعَ إِلَيَّ كُتُبَهُ وَسِلَاحَهُ وَأَمَرَنِي أَنْ آمُرَكَ إِذَا حَضَرَكَ الْمَوْتُ أَنْ تَدْفَعَ ذَلِكَ إِلَى أَخِيكَ الْحُسَيْنِ»",
      "translations": {
        "en": "Then he said to his son al-Hasan, 'O my son, the Messenger of Allah (peace be upon him and his family) commanded me to bequeath to you and to hand over to you my books and weapons, just as the Messenger of Allah (peace be upon him and his family) bequeathed to me and handed over to me his books and weapons. And he commanded me to order you, when death comes to you, to hand that over to your brother al-Husayn.'"
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "قَالَ ثُمَّ أَقْبَلَ عَلَى ابْنِهِ الْحُسَيْنِ فَقَالَ «وَأَمَرَكَ رَسُولُ اللَّهِ صَلَّى اللَّهُ عَلَيْهِ وَآلِهِ أَنْ تَدْفَعَهُ إِلَى ابْنِكَ هَذَا»",
      "translations": {
        "en": "He said, then he turned to his son al-Husayn and said, 'And the Messenger of Allah (peace be upon him and his family) commanded you to hand it over to this son of yours.'"
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "ثُمَّ أَخَذَ بِيَدِ ابْنِ ابْنِهِ عَلِيِّ بْنِ الْحُسَيْنِ وَهُوَ صَبِيٌّ فَضَمَّهُ إِلَيْهِ ثُمَّ قَالَ لِعَلِيِّ بْنِ الْحُسَيْنِ «يَا بُنَيَّ وَأَمَرَكَ رَسُولُ اللَّهِ صَلَّى اللَّهُ عَلَيْهِ وَآلِهِ أَنْ تَدْفَعَهُ إِلَى ابْنِكَ مُحَمَّدِ بْنِ عَلِيٍّ فَاقْرَأْهُ مِنْ رَسُولِ اللَّهِ صَلَّى اللَّهُ عَلَيْهِ وَآلِهِ وَمِنِّي السَّلَامَ»",
      "translations": {
        "en": "Then he took the hand of his grandson Ali ibn al-Husayn, while he was a child, and embraced him, then said to Ali ibn al-Husayn, 'O my son, the Messenger of Allah (peace be upon him and his family) commanded you to hand it over to your son Muhammad ibn Ali. Send greetings to him from the Messenger of Allah (peace be upon him and his family) and from me.'"
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "ثُمَّ أَقْبَلَ عَلَى ابْنِهِ الْحَسَنِ فَقَالَ «يَا بُنَيَّ أَنْتَ وَلِيُّ الْأَمْرِ وَوَلِيُّ الدَّمِ فَإِنْ عَفَوْتَ فَلَكَ وَإِنْ قَتَلْتَ فَضَرْبَةٌ مَكَانَ ضَرْبَةٍ وَلَا تَأْثَمْ»",
      "translations": {
        "en": "Then he turned to his son al-Hasan and said, 'O my son, you are the one in charge of the affair and the one in charge of blood (retribution). If you pardon, it is for you; if you kill, it is a blow in place of a blow, and you will not be sinful.'"
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "ثُمَّ قَالَ «اكْتُبْ بِسْمِ اللَّهِ الرَّحْمَنِ الرَّحِيمِ هَذَا مَا أَوْصَى بِهِ عَلِيُّ بْنُ أَبِي طَالِبٍ أَوْصَى أَنَّهُ يَشْهَدُ أَنْ لَا إِلَهَ إِلَّا اللَّهُ وَحْدَهُ لَا شَرِيكَ لَهُ وَأَنَّ مُحَمَّدًا عَبْدُهُ وَرَسُولُهُ أَرْسَلَهُ بِالْهُدَى وَدِينِ الْحَقِّ لِيُظْهِرَهُ عَلَى الدِّينِ كُلِّهِ وَلَوْ كَرِهَ الْمُشْرِكُونَ»",
      "translations": {
        "en": "Then he said, 'Write: In the name of Allah, the Merciful, the Compassionate. This is what Ali ibn Abi Talib bequeathed, that he testified that there is no god but Allah alone, with no partner, and that Muhammad is His servant and Messenger, whom He sent with guidance and the religion of truth, to make it prevail over all religions, even if the polytheists dislike it.'"
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "quran_quote",
      "arabic_text": "صَلَّى اللَّهُ عَلَى مُحَمَّدٍ وَآلِهِ وَسَلَّمَ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "Peace be upon Muhammad and his family."
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "quran_quote",
      "arabic_text": "إِنَّ صَلَاتِي وَنُسُكِي وَمَحْيَايَ وَمَمَاتِي لِلَّهِ رَبِّ الْعَالَمِينَ لَا شَرِيكَ لَهُ وَبِذَلِكَ أُمِرْتُ وَأَنَا مِنَ الْمُسْلِمِينَ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "Indeed, my prayer, my sacrifice, my living, and my dying are for Allah, Lord of the worlds. No partner has He. And I have been commanded to be of the Muslims."
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "ثُمَّ إِنِّي أُوصِيكَ يَا حَسَنُ وَجَمِيعَ وُلْدِي وَأَهْلَ بَيْتِي وَمَنْ بَلَغَهُ كِتَابِي مِنَ الْمُؤْمِنِينَ بِتَقْوَى اللَّهِ رَبِّكُمْ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "Then I bequeath to you, O Hasan, and all my offspring and the people of my house, and whoever my letter reaches from the believers, the fear of Allah, your Lord."
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "quran_quote",
      "arabic_text": "وَلَا تَمُوتُنَّ إِلَّا وَأَنْتُمْ مُسْلِمُونَ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "And do not die except while you are Muslims."
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "quran_quote",
      "arabic_text": "وَاعْتَصِمُوا بِحَبْلِ اللَّهِ جَمِيعًا وَلَا تَفَرَّقُوا",
      "translations": {
        "en": "And hold firmly to the rope of Allah all together and do not divide."
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "فَإِنِّي سَمِعْتُ رَسُولَ اللَّهِ صَلَّى اللَّهُ عَلَيْهِ وَآلِهِ يَقُولُ «صَلَاحُ ذَاتِ الْبَيْنِ أَفْضَلُ مِنْ عَامَّةِ الصَّلَاةِ وَالصَّوْمِ»",
      "translations": {
        "en": "For I heard the Messenger of Allah (peace be upon him and his family) say, 'The rectification of relations (between people) is better than most prayer and fasting.'"
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "وَإِنَّ الْبِغْضَةَ حَالِقَةُ الدِّينِ وَفَسَادُ ذَاتِ الْبَيْنِ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "And indeed, hatred is the shaver of religion, and the corruption of relations."
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "quran_quote",
      "arabic_text": "لَا قُوَّةَ إِلَّا بِاللَّهِ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "There is no power except with Allah."
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "انْظُرُوا ذَوِي أَرْحَامِكُمْ فَصِلُوهُمْ يُهَوِّنِ اللَّهُ عَلَيْكُمُ الْحِسَابَ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "Look to your relatives and maintain ties with them; Allah will lighten the reckoning for you."
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "وَاللَّهَ اللَّهَ فِي الْيَتَامِ فَالَا تُغِبُّوا أَفْوَاهَهُمْ وَلَا يَضِيعُوا بِحَضْرَتِكُمْ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "And to Allah I adjure you, to Allah I adjure you, regarding the orphans: do not make them wait (for their food) and do not let them go hungry in your presence."
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "فَقَدْ سَمِعْتُ رَسُولَ اللَّهِ صَلَّى اللَّهُ عَلَيْهِ وَآلِهِ يَقُولُ «مَنْ عَالَ يَتِيمًا حَتَّى يَسْتَغْنِيَ أَوْجَبَ اللَّهُ لَهُ الْجَنَّةَ كَمَا أَوْجَبَ لَآكِلِ مَالِ الْيَتِيمِ النَّارَ»",
      "translations": {
        "en": "For I heard the Messenger of Allah (peace be upon him and his family) say, 'Whoever supports an orphan until he becomes independent, Allah will make Paradise obligatory for him, just as He made obligatory the Fire for the one who consumes the orphan's wealth.'"
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "وَاللَّهَ اللَّهَ فِي الْقُرْآنِ فَالَا يَسْبِقَنَّكُمْ إِلَى الْعَمَلِ بِهِ غَيْرُكُمْ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "And to Allah I adjure you, to Allah I adjure you, regarding the Quran: let not others precede you in acting upon it."
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "وَاللَّهَ اللَّهَ فِي بَيْتِ اللَّهِ فَالَا يَخْلُوَنَّ مِنْكُمْ مَا بَقِيتُمْ فَإِنَّهُ إِنْ يُتْرَكْ لَمْ تُنَاظَرُوا",
      "translations": {
        "en": "And to Allah I adjure you, to Allah I adjure you, regarding the House of Allah: let it not be empty of you as long as you remain. For if it is left empty, you will not be questioned (about it)."
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "وَإِنَّ أَدْنَى مَا يَرْجِعُ بِهِ مَنْ أَمَّهُ أَنْ يُغْفَرَ لَهُ مَا قَدْ سَلَفَ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "And indeed, the least reward for the one who leads it is that his past sins are forgiven."
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "وَاللَّهَ اللَّهَ فِي الصَّلَاةِ فَإِنَّهَا خَيْرُ الْعَمَلِ وَإِنَّهَا عَمُودُ دِينِكُمْ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "And to Allah I adjure you, to Allah I adjure you, regarding the prayer, for it is the best of deeds and it is the pillar of your religion."
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "وَاللَّهَ اللَّهَ فِي الزَّكَاةِ فَإِنَّهَا تُطْفِئُ غَضَبَ رَبِّكُمْ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "And to Allah I adjure you, to Allah I adjure you, regarding the alms-tax, for it extinguishes the anger of your Lord."
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "وَاللَّهَ اللَّهَ فِي شَهْرِ رَمَضَانَ فَإِنَّ صِيَامَهُ جُنَّةٌ مِنَ النَّارِ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "And to Allah I adjure you, to Allah I adjure you, regarding the month of Ramadan, for its fasting is a shield from the Fire."
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "وَاللَّهَ اللَّهَ فِي الْفُقَرَاءِ وَالْمَسَاكِينِ فَشَارِكُوهُمْ فِي مَعِيشَتِكُمْ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "And to Allah I adjure you, to Allah I adjure you, regarding the poor and the needy, so share with them in your livelihood."
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "وَاللَّهَ اللَّهَ فِي الْجِهَادِ فِي سَبِيلِ اللَّهِ بِأَمْوَالِكُمْ وَأَنْفُسِكُمْ فَإِنَّمَا يُجَاهِدُ فِي سَبِيلِ اللَّهِ رَجُلَانِ إِمَامٌ هُدًى وَمُطِيعٌ لَهُ مُقْتَدٍ بِهُدَاهُ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "And to Allah I adjure you, to Allah I adjure you, regarding jihad in the way of Allah with your wealth and yourselves. Indeed, only two people strive in the way of Allah: an Imam who guides, and one who obeys him and follows his guidance."
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "وَاللَّهَ اللَّهَ فِي ذُرِّيَّةِ نَبِيِّكُمْ فَالَا يُظْلَمُنَّ بَيْنَ أَظْهُرِكُمْ وَأَنْتُمْ تَقْدِرُونَ عَلَى الدَّفْعِ عَنْهُمْ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "And to Allah I adjure you, to Allah I adjure you, regarding the offspring of your Prophet, so they are not wronged among you while you have the power to repel (wrong) from them."
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "وَاللَّهَ اللَّهَ فِي أَصْحَابِ نَبِيِّكُمْ صَلَّى اللَّهُ عَلَيْهِ وَآلِهِ الَّذِينَ لَمْ يُحْدِثُوا حَدَثًا وَلَمْ يُؤْوُوا مُحْدِثًا فَإِنَّ رَسُولَ اللَّهِ صَلَّى اللَّهُ عَلَيْهِ وَآلِهِ أَوْصَى بِهِمْ وَلَعَنَ الْمُحْدِثَ مِنْهُمْ وَمِنْ غَيْرِهِمْ وَالْمُؤْوِيَ لِلْمُحْدِثِ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "And to Allah I adjure you, to Allah I adjure you, regarding the companions of your Prophet (peace be upon him and his family) who did not innovate an innovation and did not give refuge to an innovator. For the Messenger of Allah (peace be upon him and his family) bequeathed regarding them and cursed the innovator from them and from others, and the one who gives refuge to the innovator."
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "وَاللَّهَ اللَّهَ فِي النِّسَاءِ وَمَا مَلَكَتْ أَيْمَانُكُمْ لَا تَخَافُنَّ فِي اللَّهِ لَوْمَةَ لَائِمٍ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "And to Allah I adjure you, to Allah I adjure you, regarding the women and those whom your right hands possess: do not fear the blame of the blamer in Allah."
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "فَيَكْفِيَكُمُ اللَّهُ مَنْ أَرَادَكُمْ وَبَغَى عَلَيْكُمْ فَ«قُولُوا لِلنَّاسِ حُسْنًا» كَمَا أَمَرَكُمُ اللَّهُ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "Allah will suffice you against whoever aims at you and acts hostile towards you. So, 'Speak to people in a good way,' as Allah commanded you."
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "وَلَا تَتْرُكُنَّ الْأَمْرَ بِالْمَعْرُوفِ وَالنَّهْيَ عَنِ الْمُنْكَرِ فَيُوَلِّيَ اللَّهُ الْأَمْرَ أَشْرَارَكُمْ وَتَدْعُونَ فَلَا يُسْتَجَابُ لَكُمْ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "And do not leave commanding the good and forbidding the evil, lest Allah appoint the worst of you to authority, and you call out but your call is not answered."
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "عَلَيْكُمْ يَا بَنِيَّ بِالتَّوَاصُلِ وَالتَّبَاذُلِ وَالتَّبَارِّ وَإِيَّاكُمْ وَالنِّفَاقَ وَالتَّدَابُرَ وَالتَّقَاطُعَ وَالتَّفَرُّقَ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "Upon you, O my sons, is maintaining ties, mutual giving, and mutual parting (of goods). And beware of hypocrisy, mutual turning away, mutual splitting, and division."
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "quran_quote",
      "arabic_text": "وَتَعَاوَنُوا عَلَى الْبِرِّ وَالتَّقْوَى وَلَا تَعَاوَنُوا عَلَى الْإِثْمِ وَالْعُدْوَانِ وَاتَّقُوا اللَّهَ إِنَّ اللَّهَ شَدِيدُ الْعِقَابِ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "And cooperate in righteousness and piety; do not cooperate in sin and aggression. And fear Allah; indeed, Allah is severe in penalty."
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "حَفِظَكُمُ اللَّهُ مِنْ أَهْلِ بَيْتٍ وَحَفِظَ فِيكُمْ نَبِيَّكُمْ أَسْتَوْدِعُكُمُ اللَّهَ وَأَقْرَأُ عَلَيْكُمُ السَّلَامَ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "May Allah protect you from the people of the house, and may He preserve your Prophet among you. I entrust you to Allah and send you greetings."
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "closing",
      "arabic_text": "ثُمَّ لَمْ يَزَلْ يَقُولُ «لَا إِلَهَ إِلَّا اللَّهُ» حَتَّى قُبِضَ عَلَيْهِ السَّلَامُ فِي أَوَّلِ لَيْلَةٍ مِنَ الْعَشْرِ الْأَاخِرِ مِنْ شَهْرِ رَمَضَانَ لَيْلَةَ إِحْدَى وَعِشْرِينَ - لَيْلَةَ جُمُعَةٍ سَنَةَ أَرْبَعِينَ مِنَ الْهِجْرَةِ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "Then he did not cease saying, 'There is no god but Allah,' until he was taken (died) (peace be upon him) on the first night of the last ten nights of Ramadan, the night of twenty-one - the night of Friday, in the year forty of the Hijra."
      }
    },
